WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,460
I was just scratched by a knife

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:05,980
It was really scratched with a knife

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,250
Go in by yourself

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:17,670
Boss, I am not becoming a loser

5
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:20,430
I just let it go through reflection

6
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:21,510
I am not lost

7
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:22,830
Why do you control my life?

8
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:23,910
who do you think you are

9
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:24,910
let me go

10
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:27,620
Just a vicious dog with no humanity

11
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,110
You can't even be pierced by his bones.

12
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,550
We need to get out of here as soon as possible

13
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,230
Are you right? Captain Han, yes, yes.

14
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:34,190
It's too dangerous here

15
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,150
Must evacuate as soon as possible

16
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,860
But I always feel that Captain Han is very perfunctory to me.

17
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,540
I can't feel your sincerity

18
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,820
After all, doing is always better than talking

19
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:44,940
It shows more sincerity, right Captain Rong?

20
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,140
Don’t P.O.A. my boss

21
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,060
He traveled thousands of miles to save his life
